@page "/sponsor"

<SeoHead Title="Support BasketElo | Basketball Data Sponsorship"
         Description="Support BasketElo, an independent basketball analytics project, through thoughtful sponsorships relevant to basketball fans, data, training, and sports media."
         CanonicalPath="/sponsor" />

<div class="info-page sponsor-page">
    <header class="info-hero sponsor-hero be-reveal" style="--reveal-order: 0">
        <div class="info-hero-copy">
            <p class="info-kicker">Support</p>
            <h1>Open to the right sponsorship.</h1>
            <p class="info-lede">BasketElo is an independent, spare-time project. I am open to meaningful sponsorships that fit the site and are genuinely relevant to people who follow basketball and data.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="sponsor-contact-link" href="https://x.com/sergitm12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Get in touch</span>
            <strong>Message @@sergitm12</strong>
            <small>on X <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></small>
        </a>
    </header>

    <aside class="support-placeholder be-reveal" style="--reveal-order: 1" aria-label="Buy me a coffee placeholder">
        <div>
            <p class="info-kicker">Coming soon</p>
            <h2>Buy me a coffee</h2>
        </div>
        <p>A simple one-off way to support the project will live here. For now, meaningful sponsorship conversations are welcome.</p>
    </aside>

    <section class="info-section info-section-last be-reveal" style="--reveal-order: 2" aria-labelledby="meaningful-heading">
        <div class="info-section-label"><span>01</span><span>A good fit</span></div>
        <div class="info-section-body">
            <h2 id="meaningful-heading">Relevant, useful, and easy on the reader.</h2>
            <div class="sponsor-fit">
                <article><h3>Meaningful</h3><p>A natural fit with basketball, analysis, data, training, media, or the tools people around the sport actually use.</p></article>
                <article><h3>Unobtrusive</h3><p>Clearly labelled and thoughtfully placed. No pop-ups, autoplay, cluttered ad walls, or pretending sponsored content is editorial.</p></article>
            </div>
            <p class="sponsor-note">I do not have fixed packages. If you have an idea that could support the project without making the site worse, I would be happy to hear it.</p>
            <a class="info-text-link" href="https://x.com/sergitm12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
